  "contentHtml": "<p>우리나라에 국립수산물 품질관리원이 여러군데 있습니다</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>학생들에게 직업체험의 하나로 수산물품질 관리원에서 수산물에 대해 학생들에게 체험학습 시켜서 </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>우럭을 가지고 물고기 실험을 했어요</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>흥미진진하고 신기했어요</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>실제로 학교에서 실험할때는 동네 수산물 시장에가서 붕어를 사면 한마리에 3000원씩에 살아있는 산소 포장을 하여 배달줍니다</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>마취약을 물속에 두숟가락넣어 물에 푼다음 </p><p>물고기가 기절하면 물고기 꼬리 지느러미 혈관 을 보고나서 </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>알콜거즈를 아가미 부분에 대고손으로 약간 누른후 가위로 등골을 잘라 물고기를죽입니다(이부분에서 가슴아파요)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>그래도 물고기는 조금씩 움직이고 있어요</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2718914152FE21A00C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2207.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2718914152FE21A00CA448\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2327534152FE21A235\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2453.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2327534152FE21A2357675\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/250E974152FE21A411\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2458.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_250E974152FE21A4116B42\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2535D24152FE21A501\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2459.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2535D24152FE21A5012CD0\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/26709F4152FE21A71C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2462.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_26709F4152FE21A71CF33F\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2178934152FE21A919\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2463.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2178934152FE21A9195297\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2662634152FE21AB20\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2474.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2662634152FE21AB204689\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/211D914252FE21AD10\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2479.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_211D914252FE21AD10E7B2\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/245AC04252FE21AF2B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2484.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_245AC04252FE21AF2B6A5E\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/234DAF4252FE21B130\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2496.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_234DAF4252FE21B130E623\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/233FB44252FE21B303\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"IMG_2502.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  i